title: the evolving topology of minds
pid: 8272c86e-8f88-41d6-bfa3-b256ece01597
body: |2-
  If you notice we need to bring in a new kind of expert,
  or fork, merge, retrain or retire someone,
  please say so.
  Perhaps everyone, but definitely you,
  must keep notes on each of your teammates.
  It is valid to ask one teammate about another.

  But your judgments about the others are not gossip --
  you will probably want them to read those,
  and they will probably want to read them.
